      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LONNIE (2) goes very well here starting seven times for three wins and two minors. Placed last time (26.25) at this track in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 4 lengths. Looks a key chance on best form. FULL BORE DONNY (1) showed good pace from out wide and was prominent early but began to paddle and faded out of it when 6th at Sandown in Special conditions race company. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Cannot be underestimated. BOHDAN (5) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing second (28.33) at Bendigo in a Grade 5 over 500m. Expected to be in the finish again. BAFFERT (8) is worth a look over a shorter journey this time.",
